# PLAN-931 a2r owned-temporaries suite — the D-925-2 Rust-side closure's
# evidence set (ac-a2r/hir-record-text-emit-v1): five sources through the
# real A2X record/text chain pinning the CORRECTED consumer-anchored
# emission bytes — multi-arg view temps freed after the call (wrap),
# statement-root consumers (derived-view), short-circuit side isolation
# (short-circuit), verified move/mut param modes (modes), and
# ownership-transfer responsibility (ownership). Every golden is a
# first-time capture of the fixed emission (no pre-existing expectation
# was overwritten); value/event/fault/peak/store oracles live in the
# a2x-worker conformance probes. The runtime event ledgers, fault
# atomicity, live-peak bound, print-version axis and warm-edit lifecycle
# are asserted there, not here.

